      "extract": "forward Compton scattering tensor. In 1975, Gasser and Leutwyler provided the determination [9] δMγ = 0.76(30) MeV. (1.4) If we instead subtract the lattice QCD determination from experiment, we arrive at δMp−n −δMmd−mu LQCD = 1.24(40) MeV. (1.5) While the central values in these two determinations are quite different, they are only one-sigma discrepant. A more precise determination of either δMγ or δMmd−mu is",
